flowchart LR
    U[User Question] --> UI[Local UI / CLI]
    UI --> P[LLM Provider]
    P --> LLM[Qwen3 / GPT-4o / Gemini]

    GDS[(Public GDS Layout)] --> I[Layout Inspector]
    I --> C[Coordinates and Shape Metadata]
    C --> LLM

    LLM --> R[Retrieve Supported Rules]
    R --> RC[Curated SKY130 Rule Corpus]
    RC --> R

    LLM --> D[run_drc Tool]
    D --> K[KLayout DRC Engine]
    K --> DECK[Pinned SKY130 DRC Deck]
    DECK --> K
    K --> E[DRC Evidence:
    Status / Limits / Markers]

    LLM --> CLAIM[Structured PASS / FAIL / REFUSE Claims]
    E --> V[Deterministic Verifier]
    CLAIM --> V
    V -->|Accepted| O[Grounded Explanation]
    V -->|Rejected| X[Protocol / Claim Repair]
    X --> LLM

    O --> T[Explanation + Sources + Trace]
